#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "upgrade from the IBM Quantum Open Plan to an IBM Cloud Pay-As-You-Go Plan"
msgstr "naik taraf daripada IBM Quantum Open Plan ke IBM Cloud Pay-As-You-Go Plan"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade from the Open Plan"
msgstr "Naik taraf daripada Pelan Terbuka"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade from the Open Plan {#upgrade-from-the-open-plan}"
msgstr "Naik taraf daripada Pelan Terbuka {#upgrade-from-the-open-plan}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide is for entities who want to upgrade from the IBM Quantum&reg; Open Plan to an IBM Cloud&reg; Pay-As-You-Go Plan. For instructions to set up a cloud account, set up a service instance, and work with users, follow these steps.\n"
msgstr "Panduan ini untuk entiti yang ingin naik taraf daripada IBM Quantum&reg; Open Plan ke IBM Cloud&reg; Pay-As-You-Go Plan. Untuk arahan menyediakan akaun awan, menyediakan contoh perkhidmatan, dan bekerja dengan pengguna, ikuti langkah-langkah berikut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are an individual setting up the service for the first time or if you have been invited to an instance by an administrator, follow the steps in [Install Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit) instead.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda seorang individu yang menyediakan perkhidmatan buat kali pertama atau jika anda telah dijemput ke contoh oleh pentadbir, ikuti langkah-langkah dalam [Pasang Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit) sebaliknya.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Sebelum anda mulakan {#before-you-begin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If necessary, follow the steps in the [Set up to use IBM Cloud](/guides/cloud-setup#cloud) section to complete the following:\n"
msgstr "Jika perlu, ikuti langkah-langkah dalam bahagian [Sediakan untuk menggunakan IBM Cloud](/guides/cloud-setup#cloud) untuk melengkapkan perkara berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sign up for an IBM Cloud account.\n"
msgstr "Daftar untuk akaun IBM Cloud.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an IBM Quantum instance.\n"
msgstr "Cipta contoh IBM Quantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"update-cloud-account\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"update-cloud-account\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade your IBM Cloud account {#upgrade-your-ibm-cloud-account}"
msgstr "Naik taraf akaun IBM Cloud anda {#upgrade-your-ibm-cloud-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Skip this if you already have an IBM Cloud Pay-as-you-go account. All new IBM Cloud accounts are set up as Pay-as-you-go.\n"
msgstr "Langkau ini jika anda sudah mempunyai akaun IBM Cloud Pay-as-you-go. Semua akaun IBM Cloud baharu ditetapkan sebagai Pay-as-you-go.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You must upgrade your IBM Cloud account in the following circumstances:\n"
msgstr "Anda mesti menaik taraf akaun IBM Cloud anda dalam keadaan berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "You have a Trial account.\n"
msgstr "Anda mempunyai akaun Trial.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "You have a Lite account (deprecated) that you created before 25 October 2021.\n"
msgstr "Anda mempunyai akaun Lite (tidak digunakan lagi) yang dicipta sebelum 25 Oktober 2021.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After you upgrade, you can continue to use any instances that you created with your Lite account. To upgrade to a Pay-As-You-Go account, complete the following steps:\n"
msgstr "Selepas anda menaik taraf, anda boleh terus menggunakan sebarang contoh yang anda cipta dengan akaun Lite anda. Untuk menaik taraf ke akaun Pay-As-You-Go, lengkapkan langkah-langkah berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Go to Manage > [Account](https://cloud.ibm.com/account) in the IBM Cloud console.\n"
msgstr "Pergi ke Urus > [Akaun](https://cloud.ibm.com/account) dalam konsol IBM Cloud.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Select **Account settings**, and click **Add credit card**.\n"
msgstr "Pilih **Tetapan akaun**, dan klik **Tambah kad kredit**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enter your payment information and click **Next** to submit your information.\n"
msgstr "Masukkan maklumat pembayaran anda dan klik **Seterusnya** untuk menghantar maklumat anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After your payment information is processed, your account is upgraded.\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"You will not be charged unless you create a Pay-As-You-Go Plan instance and use it to send workloads to QPUs.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Selepas maklumat pembayaran anda diproses, akaun anda ditingkatkan.\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Anda tidak akan dikenakan bayaran melainkan anda mencipta contoh Pay-As-You-Go Plan dan menggunakannya untuk menghantar beban kerja ke QPU.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Access your Pay-As-You-Go Plan {#access-your-pay-as-you-go-plan}"
msgstr "Akses Pay-As-You-Go Plan anda {#access-your-pay-as-you-go-plan}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To use your IBM Cloud Pay-As-You-Go Plan, create a new [instance](/guides/instances) and assign it to the Pay-As-You-Go Plan.  <ins>All jobs sent to QPUs by specifying this instance will incur a cost.</ins>  To use QPUs without incurring a cost, you must use an instance assigned to the Open plan or other free plan, if you have one.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menggunakan IBM Cloud Pay-As-You-Go Plan anda, cipta [contoh](/guides/instances) baharu dan tetapkannya kepada Pay-As-You-Go Plan.  <ins>Semua job yang dihantar ke QPU dengan menentukan contoh ini akan menanggung kos.</ins>  Untuk menggunakan QPU tanpa menanggung kos, anda mesti menggunakan contoh yang ditetapkan kepada pelan Terbuka atau pelan percuma lain, jika anda memilikinya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is recommended that you set up a [cost limit](/guides/manage-cost#cost-limit) on the instance and learn about other ways to manage your cost when using the Pay-As-You-Go Plan.\n"
msgstr "Adalah disyorkan agar anda menetapkan [had kos](/guides/manage-cost#cost-limit) pada contoh dan mengetahui cara lain untuk mengurus kos anda apabila menggunakan Pay-As-You-Go Plan.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  -  [Manage cost](/guides/manage-cost) when using the Pay-As-You-Go Plan.\n"
"  -  Learn about the available [plans](/guides/plans-overview).\n"
"  -  Follow the steps in the [Run your first circuit on hardware](/guides/hello-world) guide to write and run a quantum program.\n"
"  -  Try a [tutorial](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"
"  -  [Urus kos](/guides/manage-cost) apabila menggunakan Pay-As-You-Go Plan.\n"
"  -  Ketahui tentang [pelan-pelan](/guides/plans-overview) yang tersedia.\n"
"  -  Ikuti langkah-langkah dalam [Hello world](/guides/hello-world) untuk menulis dan menjalankan program kuantum.\n"
"  -  Cuba [tutorial](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
